  'On: each line uses its country exit. If the proxy or UDP validation fails, only that line’s VoWiFi stops; it will not leak through the host’s default network.': '当前开启：每条线路使用对应的国家出口。代理或 UDP 验证失败时，只停止该线路的 VoWiFi，不会从宿主机默认网络泄漏。',
  'Off: country exits are bypassed and VoWiFi uses the host’s default network. Country assignments and proxy settings are kept for later.': '当前关闭：绕过所有国家出口，VoWiFi 使用宿主机默认网络；国家绑定和代理配置会保留，之后可再次开启。',
  'Add proxy': '添加代理', 'Choose a source type. You can change the details before adding it to the library.': '选择代理来源，并填写对应信息后添加到代理库。',
