  'Paste one share link. Supports VLESS Reality/XHTTP, Trojan, Hysteria2, Shadowsocks and VMess.': '粘贴一个节点分享链接；支持 VLESS Reality/XHTTP、Trojan、Hysteria2、Shadowsocks 和 VMess。',
  'Connect to a SOCKS5 server directly. It must support UDP ASSOCIATE for VoWiFi.': '直接连接 SOCKS5 服务；用于 VoWiFi 时必须支持 UDP ASSOCIATE。',
