  'Insert one of these SIMs into a reader or modem and its line becomes manageable again. Delete is for lines you no longer own — a ported-away number, or an entry left over from testing.': '把 SIM 插入读卡器或模块后，对应线路即可重新管理。删除用于你已不再持有的线路——已携号转出的号码，或早期测试留下的条目。',
  'Delete SIM line “{name}” (ID {id})? Its IMS settings, saved PIN and runtime files are removed. Messages and call records are kept.': '删除 SIM 线路「{name}」（ID {id}）？将移除其 IMS 配置、已保存的 PIN 和运行时文件。短信与通话记录会保留。',
