  'Record a message when a call to this line goes unanswered — including when no browser is open. A call you decline on the softphone is never recorded.': '当打到这条线路的来电无人接听时（包括浏览器未打开）录下留言。在软电话上主动拒接的来电不会留言。',
  'Use the system default ({state})': '跟随系统默认（当前{state}）',
  'On for this line': '本线路开启', 'Off for this line': '本线路关闭', on: '开启', off: '关闭', 'There are voicemails you have not played': '有未收听的语音留言', 'New voicemail': '新留言', Play: '播放', 'Not played yet': '未收听',
